        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Communication Visionaries: McLuhan, Innis, Licklider, Negroponte",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "McLUHAN (1964-1980):\n  The medium IS the message — not what is transmitted\n    but the structure of the transmission changes\n    how people think\n  Hot vs. cool media; global village; the electronic age\n  Anticipates: internet as the return to oral/tribal\n    community (the \"global village\")"
    },
    {
