        "title": "Communication Visionaries: McLuhan, Innis, Licklider, Negroponte",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "LICKLIDER (1960-1968):\n  The computer must become a partner in human cognition.\n  Man-computer symbiosis: computer amplifies human intelligence\n  ARPANet memo (1963): the \"Intergalactic Computer Network\"\n  → He wrote the memo that launched the internet"
    },
    {
