        "title": "Communication Visionaries: McLuhan, Innis, Licklider, Negroponte",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "NEGROPONTE (1979-1995):\n  Being Digital: everything becomes bits; atoms → bits transition\n  Convergence: all media become digital; all digital media converge\n  Personalization: media becomes individual rather than mass\n  → MIT Media Lab: he built the institutional infrastructure\n    for digital media research"
    },
